  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ae309fc9b93c4434b888290b1d747f9a, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TeacherInteraction
  playerMovement: {fileID: 0}
  teacherName: Almeida
  dialoguePopUp: {fileID: 208243415}
  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1165950374}
  spellSelectionScreen: {fileID: 0}
  battleScreen: {fileID: 0}
  element: 
  totalNumOfElementSpells: 0
  battleCanvas: {fileID: 1084373328}
  eventSystem: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - Hello! Bonjour! Ciao! Hej!
  - Welcome in, charName!
  - I like to think of myself as a culture enthusiast, and my recent fascination
    is ancient magic
  - "But you\u2019re here for a trial, yes?"
  - You must be sensitive to respond to the barest traces of water to harness water
    magic.
  - Go try dodging those water jets.
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - Whew, that was a little tiring.
  - "But I\u2019m ready to go, the force of a wave can\u2019t be stopped, on to our
    duel."
  afterBattleLines:
  - "Here\u2019s what I\u2019ve discovered, charName. Ancient magic is much older
    than you and me, and it\u2019s very powerful."
  - " I don\u2019t exactly like the power it holds, but it\u2019s important to understand
    how it works, to prevent any uprisings from happening like before..."
  - "Err, I\u2019ve probably said too much. Here, to help you on your way to becoming
    an even more powerful magician."
  afterSpellLines:
  - "Remember, it\u2019s not always the more the merrier, even when it comes to knowledge."
  - Pick and choose your masteries carefully.
